  "solution": "**BODMAS Table:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/7751840ca1840d12cadc428f84d30e2cdcd5e7f82d52a57de21f2404c58eed88.png] \n\n**Given Equation: **42 * 7 * 3 * 2 * 13 * 7\n\nLet's check each option one by one:\n\nOption 1) ÷, ×, −, =, × \n\nGiven: 42 * 7 * 3 * 2 * 13 * 7\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n__**42 ÷ 7**__ × 3 - 2 = 13 × 7\n\n__**6 × 3**__ - 2 = __**13 × 7**__\n\n__**18 - 2**__ = 91\n\n16 ≠ 91.\n\nOption 2) +, =, ÷, ×, +\n\nGiven: 42 * 7 * 3 * 2 * 13 * 7\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n42 + 7 = __**3 ÷ 2**__ × 13 + 7\n\n42 + 7 = __**1.5 × 13**__ + 7\n\n__**42 + 7**__ = __**19.5 + 7**__\n\n49 ≠ 26.5.\n\nOption 3) ÷, ×, =, +, +\n\nGiven: 42 * 7 * 3 * 2 * 13 * 7\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n__**42 ÷ 7**__ × 3 = 2 + 13 + 7\n\n__**6 × 3**__ = 2 + 13 + 7\n\n18 = __**2 + 13 + 7**__\n\n18 ≠ 22.\n\n**Option 4) ÷, ×, +, =, +** \n\nGiven: 42 * 7 * 3 * 2 * 13 * 7\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n__**42 ÷ 7**__ × 3 + 2 = 13 + 7\n\n__**6 × 3**__ + 2 = 13 + 7\n\n__**18 + 2**__ = __**13 + 7**__\n\n__**20 = 20.**__\n\nHence, the correct answer is ***'Option 4'.***",
